    "result_text": "The full suite (a single `AcceptanceTest` class) is green. The change is complete.\n\n## Summary\n\nThe `GET /api/owners/{id}` response now includes `selfLink` = `/api/owners/<id>`. Two edits:\n\n1. **`src/main/resources/openapi.yml`** \u2014 Added a `selfLink` read-only string property to the `Owner` schema (which is what generates `OwnerDto` at build time), mirroring the other derived read-only fields.\n\n2. **`src/main/java/.../mapper/OwnerMapper.java`** \u2014 Added a MapStruct mapping that computes the value from the owner's own id:\n   ```java\n   @Mapping(target = \"selfLink\", expression = \"java(owner.getId() == null ? null : \\\"/api/owners/\\\" + owner.getId())\")\n   ```\n   The null-guard keeps it safe for any owner lacking an id, while the persisted owner always has one.\n\n`./mvnw test` \u2192 **BUILD SUCCESS**, `Tests run: 1, Failures: 0, Errors: 0`, with the new `coreReturnsSelfLink` assertion (`$.selfLink == \"/api/owners/\" + id`) passing.",
